      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“瞧！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "你这么认为是不行的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You must not think that way.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你原本并不想把镜子安放在这儿的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You never meant to place the mirror here in the first place,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "却不经意安在这里了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but without thinking you set it here,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "结果庭院里动物的栏圈都映现在镜子里了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and as a result even the animal pens in the garden were reflected in the mirror,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01890",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "你不是惊愕地用手紧抓住左侧那面镜框了吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "didn't you grasp the frame on the left side tightly with your hand in astonishment?”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
